 "title": "Highway Department - Edmunds County, South Dakota",
 "text": "Highway Department - Edmunds County, South Dakota\nOctober 18, 2026\nEdmunds County, South Dakota\nHome\nAbout\nHistory\nDirectory »\nAuditor\nClerk of Courts\nHighway Department\nEmergency Management\nDirector of Equalization\n4-H Program\nPlanning & Zoning\nPublic Health\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nSheriff\nStates Attorney\nWelfare\nVeteran Services\nCommission »\nCommission Agenda\nCommission Minutes\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Ordinances\nCounty Financials\nForms\nNotices\nEmployment\nQuick Links\nHighway Department\nHighway Superintendent:\nDale Preszler\n210 2nd Ave Ste 107\nPO Box 38\nIpswich, SD 57451\nPhone: 605-426-6761\nFax: 605-426-6538\nEmail: hwy.edco@midconetwork.com / supt.edco@midconetwork.com\nThe County Highway Superintendents, subject to the approval of the Board of County Commissioners, are in charge of constructing, maintaining and repairing all of South Dakota’s county roads and bridges. The Edmunds County Highway Department maintains 378.88 miles on the county road system. Highway Superintendents, in many cases, also maintain the township roads in their county. In each county, the Highway Superintendent is charged with the direction and supervision of work and keeps record of costs. The Highway Superintendent must approve all bills associated with county road maintenance before payment. Payment for work on county road systems is made from the county road and bridge fund.\nOther Helpful Information:\nUtilities on Right-of-Way\nHighway Department Links:\nhttp://www.safetravelusa.com/\nhttp://www.sddot.com/\n2026-2027 Township Officers Download\nCommissioner Meeting October 27, 2026 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\nCommissioner Meeting November 5, 2026 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\nCommissioner Meeting November 24, 2026 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\nClosed – Thanksgiving November 26, 2026 All-day\nClosed – Thanksgiving November 27, 2026 All-day\nNEW Edmunds County GIS Website!\nhttps://www.1stdistrict.org/edmundsts/\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
